; dsound.dll proxy exports. The game imports dsound by ORDINAL, so we export by ordinal and match the
; numbers. NONAME keeps the export table ordinal-only, exactly like the real dsound entries the game
; binds. Each maps to a tail-jump thunk that forwards to the same ordinal in the real system dsound.
LIBRARY dsound
EXPORTS
    Thunk1  @1  NONAME
    Thunk2  @2  NONAME
    Thunk3  @3  NONAME
    Thunk4  @4  NONAME
    Thunk5  @5  NONAME
    Thunk6  @6  NONAME
    Thunk7  @7  NONAME
    Thunk8  @8  NONAME
    Thunk9  @9  NONAME
    Thunk10 @10 NONAME
    Thunk11 @11 NONAME
    Thunk12 @12 NONAME
